<p>Kids always find fire fascinating. Why not? It really is the only thing that separates us from the animals.</p>
<img src="20190907_185311.jpg" />

<p>Dominic loves both dogs but Lilly is more his size.</p>
<img src="20190907_185915.jpg" />
<img src="20190907_191726.jpg" />

<p>After sunset, because we'd gotten so little sleep the night before, most of us were looking forward to an early bedtime. But first: A flashlight walk.</p>
<img src="20190907_191727.jpg" />

<p>A final drink box and then time for bed!</p>
